00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:20.770
Apa ?

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.980
Saya membayar 800 poin kehidupan ke Special Summon a

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:29.610
Monster Synchro tanpa efek dari kuburanku !

